{
  "about": [
    "Scripted edits, replayed by scripts/export-board-conformance.mjs (a JS model of a native editor's edits, serialized",
    "by app/vault/excalidraw.js) and by any port's own editor; the two must write the same file.",
    "Randomness is mulberry32(seed), the clock is `now`, text is measured at 0.6 em per UTF-16 unit.",
    "\"$N\" is the Nth id an op created in this scenario, \"$last\" the latest; \"own\" is the element's own box."
